 "flag_valid": true,
 "flag_for_decision": false,
 "flag_rule": "set when the posterior median adverse VaR99.5 at either vignette moves by more than 5% against the delta = 0 control and by more than the control's seed-to-seed spread, under the headline size-only operator; if set, the numbers go to Colin as decision C of D3-3 (adopt the skewed shock). It is None, and flag_valid is False, when a control does not reproduce the headline: that control is no noise floor",
 "flag_caveat": "the two delta = 0 controls share the replicate seed and the posterior positions, so their spread is tiny and in practice the 5% line decides the flag; a move just beyond the line is weak evidence and the PC reads the moves, not the flag alone",
 "overlay_sensitivity_note": "no overlay leg: the skew-t fit and its controls fix gamma at 0 in the likelihood (the headline's construction since option B, 10 October 2026), so they have no fitted concentration exponent for an overlay to apply; the overlay is reported on the full-sample gamma-free fit only"
